SUMMARY IN ENGLISH (the Portuguese text prevails)
This is proprietary, source-available software — not open source. Subscribers
may fork and restyle the interface and share themes, for use only with the
official Cursoflix app and an active subscription. Reverse engineering,
bypassing the subscription check, building replacement apps or backends,
redistribution and commercial use are prohibited. Using any part of this
software to train, fine-tune, evaluate or index AI/ML systems, or using AI
systems to reverse engineer, reproduce or bypass it, is expressly prohibited.
